  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven equation: 56 + 41 ÷ 12054 – 123 × 891 = ?\n\nAccording to the question, after '÷' and '–' are interchanged and '×' and '+' are interchanged:\n\n56 + 41 ÷ 12054 – 123 × 891 = ? ⇒ 56 × 41 – 12054 ÷ 123 + 891 = ?\n\n⇒ 56 × 41 – __**12054 **____**÷**____** 123**__ + 891 = ?\n\n⇒ __**56 ×**____** 41**__ – 98 + 891 = ?\n\n⇒ __**2296**____** + 891**__ – 98 = ?\n\n⇒ __**3187**____** – 98**__ = ?\n\n⇒ 3089 = ?\n\nHence, \"Option 3\" is the correct answer.",
